  * libyal libraries (https://github.com/libyal), licensed under the
    GNU Lesser General Public License, Version 3.0 (LGPL-3.0-or-later):
      - libevtx  (Windows Event Log parsing)
      - libregf  (Windows Registry hive parsing)
      - liblnk   (Windows Shell Link / .lnk parsing)
      - libscca  (Windows Prefetch parsing)
      - libolecf (OLE2 Compound File parsing)
      - libesedb (Extensible Storage Engine / ESE database parsing)
      - libfsapfs (Apple APFS filesystem parsing)
      - libewf   (EWF/E01 disk image format)
      - libvhdi  (VHD/VHDX disk image format)
      - libvmdk  (VMDK disk image format)

